WEBVTT

00:00:08.168 --> 00:00:11.376
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Vienna left Italy in April 2022 and,

00:00:12.092 --> 00:00:15.914
when I spoke to her again, she was in Kazakhstan.

00:00:16.741 --> 00:00:20.920
By December 2024, she hoped to reach Mongolia,

00:00:21.233 --> 00:00:24.037
where the true story of Marco Polo began.

00:00:24.958 --> 00:00:28.855
We asked her if she had any plans for more traveling, and she said,

00:00:29.294 --> 00:00:33.674
“In the future, I’d like to travel around the world. But nothing is certain.”